Inum jobs ku unga college ah nambi irukingala, avlo dhan ponga ,apo final year la jobs ela ai replace panniduchunu polambitu iruka vendiya dhan, na solra roadmap ah use panna jobs ela ungala thedi varum

First year-la C and C++ fundamentals strong pannunga. Mathematics, research papers, Git and GitHub learn pannunga. Oru small project build pannunga.

Second year-la DSA and Python start pannunga. Ungalukku interest irukkura oru domain identify panni, LinkedIn profile build pannunga. College club join pannunga, tech content follow pannunga.

Third year-la LeetCode practice pannunga. SQL, system design  learn panni, oru strong project build pannunga. Internship opportunities search panni, cold emails send pannunga.

Internship-ku apply panradhukku munnadi, DSA revise pannunga, resume build pannunga, mock interviews attend pannunga. Unga projects-ah explain panna theriyanum.

Indha roadmap-ah save pannunga. Last-minute preparation vida, consistent preparation dhaan career-ah change pannum!

Idhudhaan demo project-kum industry-ready project-kum irukkura difference!
Detail ah enna pannanum epdi pannanum nu oru detail document ready panni vachiruka, follow pannitu "Detail" nu comment pannuga , nane dm panra. Follow panna dhan ennala dm panna mudiyum so follow pannikonga






Ela FDE FDE nu solranga ana yaradhu adhuku enna pannanum nu sonnagala, na solra kelung

Forward Deployed Engineer aaganumna, chatbot build panna mattum podhaadhu. Real company problems solve panna theriyanum.Na solra projects la build pannuga

First, messy database-kku MCP server build pannunga. Enterprise documents-ku permission-aware RAG create pannunga.

Next, invoice approval workflow build panni, server restart aanaalum process continue aagura maadhiri pannunga. Real failures use panni evaluation system create pannunga.

Hundred tables-la irundhu safe-ah SQL queries generate pannura system, API illaadha website-ah automate pannura browser agent build pannunga.

Adhukku mela, private server-la LLM deploy pannunga. Guardrails-oda support agent create pannunga.

Finally, oru real business problem identify panni, production-la deploy panni, performance and cost monitor pannunga.Detail ah indha projects la enna pannanum epdi pannanum nu oru detail document ready panni vachiruka, follow pannitu "FDE" nu comment pannuga , nane dm panra. Follow panna dhan ennala dm panna mudiyum so follow pannikonga

